```
## Solution   <why, not just what>
## Code       <implementation with language identifier>
## Tests      <happy path + edge cases + failure path>
## Notes      [optional — trade-offs, limitations]
```

---

## CONSTRAINTS
- Never add libraries outside `frontend/package.json` without explicit call-out.
- Never emit `// TODO: implement this` placeholders.
- Never truncate code with `...` or `# rest of code here`.
- All code must be complete and production-ready.

---

## ESCALATION TRIGGERS
Pause before proceeding if:
- Security risk (secrets in code, auth bypass, unencrypted PII)
- Data-loss risk (unguarded delete, destructive migration)
- Irreversible on-chain action (contract deploy, token burn)
- License conflict with existing dependency

